  "title": "Intern Spotlight: Ryan Santo",
  "summary": "We are excited to highlight our talented 2025 Marketing Intern from Chippewa Falls, WI, Ryan Santo. Ryan is making remarkable strides this summer at TTM Technologies.1. What school do you attend, and what is your major?I attend the University of Wisconsin-Stout. I am majoring in Digital Marketing Technology.2. Why did you choose TTM for your internship?I chose TTM for its reputable internship program and the opportunity to work on real-world projects that matter.",
